//| This EA is not another region-overwrite branch. It is the first  |
//| explicit attempt to build a genuinely adaptive state engine.     |
//|                                                                  |
//| Design intent                                                    |
//| ------------                                                    |
//| 1. Read current market behavior from candles only.               |
//| 2. Maintain explicit state categories: known / transition /      |
//|    unknown.                                                       |
//| 3. Route among a small bank of policies instead of one monolith. |
//| 4. Learn with virtual probe trades so exploration has no direct  |
//|    capital cost.                                                 |
//| 5. Only commit live capital when state confidence and policy     |
//|    evidence are both acceptable.                                 |
//|                                                                  |
//| Important scope note                                             |
//| -------------------                                              |
//| This is an initial v2.0 architecture scaffold intended for       |
//| research on EURUSD H1 2010-2019. It prioritizes structural       |
//| correctness, logging, and adaptability plumbing over full        |
//| optimization.                                                    |
//|                                                                  |
//| Region philosophy                                                |
//| -----------------                                                |
//| Regions are treated as provisional state containers, not sacred  |
//| permanent truths. New behaviors should be added as new IDs       |
//| rather than mutating earlier valid behaviors.                    |
